OTOGAKURE FORBIDDEN TECHNIQUE ARCHIVE
CLASSIFICATION: EYES OF LORD OROCHIMARU ONLY
Scroll Ref: FB-BM-014

SUBJECT: Body Modification Techniques (Nikutai Kaizo)

Overview
The following procedures permit the augmentation of a host vessel beyond its natural
limits. All modifications are performed under the direct authorization of Lord Orochimaru
or the Head Medic (K. Yakushi). Unsanctioned self-modification is grounds for termination.

Documented Procedures
1. Bone-density restructuring — grafting of Kaguya-line skeletal tissue to permit
   protrusion and remote bone growth. Reference donor: Kimimaro.
2. Dual-consciousness fusion — merging of a secondary body into a primary host
   (parasitic model). Reference subjects: Sakon / Ukon.
3. Chakra-conduit rerouting — installation of supplementary tenketsu to raise output
   ceiling. High rejection rate; see attrition notes in Research & Experiments.
4. Elastic tissue replacement — replacement of connective tissue to allow limb elongation
   and full-body regeneration, a prerequisite for later immortality work.

Warnings
Rejection presents as chakra hemorrhage, seal necrosis, or loss of motor control.
Failed vessels are logged and disposed of per compound protocol. Do not attempt any
procedure in this scroll without a medic present.
